    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>About this Game:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing First Person Shooter Game play as a little tank shooting skeletons. Enjoy the fun and please brought by the goofy skeletons and shooting them to send them flying. Different perks to be picked up to help you defeat those funny skeletons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Story:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village have a magic crystal in the middle of the forest. The skeletons are drawn to the crystal and invaded the village. You as a little tank have to protect the crystal from waves of skeletons and bring peace to the village</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
